&#x201C;John Legend is the perfect fit for this campaign,&#x201D; said Maggie Lewin, ESPN senior director of marketing. &#x201C;He is a true college football fan. He can truly talk the talk, while also bringing a sense of showmanship and entertainment value to the spectacle of the CFP in Vegas this year. The campaign is bold, fun and a little wild &#x2013; making it the perfect message for this year&#x2019;s CFP.&#x201D;

